OL,3,GNEWSASafe cycling sessions in city as
OL,4,Aevenings get darker
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad safety officers will be in
OL,7,FBrighton this week as the evenings get
OL,8,Fdarker to offer practical free
OL,9,Fvisibility items to those who cycle and
OL,10,Fwheel.
OL,12,FThe officers from Brighton & Hove City
OL,13,FCouncil (BHCC), together with Sussex
OL,14,FPolice and East Sussex Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService, will be encouraging cyclists
OL,16,Fto check that their lights are working
OL,17,Fproperly.
OL,19,FThey will be at various locations in
OL,20,Fthe city between 16:45 and 18:30 GMT
OL,21,Ffrom Monday to Friday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
